OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry through the evening but with
OL,7,Fstrengthening southeast winds. Rain
OL,8,Fand hill snow will spread north
OL,9,Fthrough the early hours and becoming
OL,10,Fwindy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FIt will be cloudy throughout
OL,13,Fthe day with outbreaks of rain and
OL,14,Fhill snow, turning heavy at times.
OL,15,FWindy in the morning with strong east
OL,16,Fto southeasterly winds, easing later.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,19,FWednesday remains rather cloudy with
OL,20,Fsome patchy rain. Thursday and Friday
OL,21,Fwill be dry and bright but chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
